  {
    "id": "anno-morioka_lower_p112_left-14",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "錢三萬八千六百五貫六百文"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "銭（ぜに）三万八千六百五貫六百文（38,605貫600文）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Miscellaneous tax paid in copper cash (雜稅錢): 38,605 kan 600 mon. This is the cash levy of the miscellaneous-tax (雜稅) group, paired with 雜稅金 (box 09) immediately to its right, just as the main-tax group pairs 正租金 (box 07) with the 錢 column (box 08). The printed head glyph is 錢; the 雜稅 attribution is structural (it is the second, left-most 錢 column, sitting left of 雜稅金). Belongs to Morioka (盛岡藩); no maru-marker on this left half-page. Absent from MASTER, which records only the one 錢 row (box 08's 23,633貫). Verified glyph-by-glyph at 3x: 錢 三 萬 八 千 六 百 五 貫 六 百 文; ink span x1339-1407, y1299-2281, clean gutters both sides (box 10 ends x1277, box 09 begins x1480), no clip, no overlap."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "盛岡雜稅錢"
      }
